// spec/settlement/referralFiles.md, "Story: Serve every filed month exactly as it was filed"; spec/settlement/referralPublication.md, "The claims read answers only the signed-in account's cached view of the active root and says when it is stale"; spec/settlement/ownerTransactions.md, "A request is reviewed against current authority and becomes a fixed plan"; spec/settlement/monthlyCommitment.md, "The first authorization, signed attempts and freeze time are immutable"; spec/settlement/signer.md, "An operator reconciles an externally recovered binding winner only through an audited request that cannot choose the outcome"; spec/settlement/publicRecords.md, "Public vault payments are paged at most 100 per page under a frozen upper bound"; spec/settlement/vaultSnapshots.md, "A failed refresh keeps the last totals marked stale"; spec/settlement/monthly.md, "The public cut list is exactly each contributor's latest change when that change is a cut"; spec/settlement/reserveRelease.md, "Only an EVM vault's release reaches service approval"
